WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:01.616
Go to the pages view.

2
00:00:01.616 --> 00:00:04.942
Find the page you want to create a child page under.

3
00:00:04.942 --> 00:00:07.339
Click the plus icon on the page row.

4
00:00:07.339 --> 00:00:12.337
A new page form opens where you can fill in information about the new page.

5
00:00:12.337 --> 00:00:15.906
Enter a clear title for the child page.

6
00:00:15.906 --> 00:00:19.410
Check the slug since it will become part of the URL.

7
00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:22.782
Select a layout for the child page before creating it.

8
00:00:22.782 --> 00:00:25.783
Click Create Page to create the child page.

9
00:00:25.783 --> 00:00:32.454
Before publishing, verify that the page's path and navigation area match the parent page you selected.
